{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ay9QbnXwjYh7crwUmFVKT5","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/turn_residual_gating/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-19\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| phase2_4way_eval_heldout | 四路消融的三路趋同结论（TG≈UG≈LoRA-only，gating 零增量）在 held-out eval 数据（idx≥8000，与训练集无重叠）上复现，排除数据重叠 confound。预期：相对比较保持（三路趋同），绝对 GAR 值可能变化。 | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **phase2_4way_eval** (negative): Turn-residual gating (TRG) improves multi-turn response quality over LoRA-only and base model baselines because it selectively amplifies conversational context signals, which should manifest as higher GAR scores across 4 conditions (base, base+TRG, LoRA, LoRA+TRG). ← 基于 phase2_tg_s42_v7\\\\n- **phase2_lora_only_s42** (success): LoRA-only baseline (gate 固定 1.0，无 gating 机制) 在相同 MSE+NTP loss 下 GAR 应低于 ThreadGate (v7)。如果 LoRA-only 也能训到 GAR~0.5，则 gating 机制贡献为零，paper story 不成立。关键对比：LoRA-only 的 GAR 收敛值 vs v7 的 0.48。 ← 基于 phase2_tg_s42_v7\\\\n- **phase2_ug_s42** (success): Uniform gating baseline: per-layer independent gates without turn conditioning (content-dependent only), to isolate whether ThreadGate's turn-conditioned gating provides benefit over content-only residual scaling. Same training setup as v7 but with gate-type=uniform. ← 基于 phase1_gar_diag\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 5 / 负向 5 / 失败 1 / 共 12\\\\ntraining_time_hours: 5.7 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\\\ntraining_time_seconds: 20588.6 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-20861: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- phase2_tg_s42_v2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- phase2_tg_s42_v4: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1486, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\"