{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RjfKVUGCAA5sBf3ZzyGyXB","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/turn_residual_gating/literature_map.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"categories:\\\\n  layer_importance:\\\\n    description: \\\\\\\"Layer-wise importance analysis, redundancy, and pruning in transformers\\\\\\\"\\\\n    papers:\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"The Unreasonable Ineffectiveness of the Deeper Layers\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Gromov et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.17887\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"发现 LLM 深层高度冗余，可删除近半层而性能不降；浅层对知识存储至关重要\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Studies knowledge storage via layer pruning. Finds minimal performance degradation until up to half of layers are removed.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"ShortGPT: Layers in Large Language Models are More Redundant Than You Expect\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Men et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.03853\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"提出 Block Influence (BI) 度量各层重要性，发现许多层高度相似且功能冗余\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Defines Block Influence (BI) metric to gauge layer significance. Discovers many LLM layers exhibit high similarity.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"The Curse of Depth in Large Language Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Sun et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"NeurIPS 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.05795\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"Pre-LN 导致深层梯度趋近恒等映射。解释 ThreadGate 中 late layers gate 接近 1.0\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Pre-Layer Normalization causes output variance to grow exponentially with depth.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Reassessing Layer Pruning in LLMs: New Insights and Methods\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Anonymous\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.15558\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: context\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"删除最后 25% 层 + 微调即可获得强性能，证实深层冗余\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Simply pruning the final 25% of layers followed by fine-tuning yields strong performance.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Reducing Transformer Depth on Demand with Structured Dropout (LayerDrop)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Fan et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2020\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2020\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1909.11556\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"ThreadGate 的 gating 可视为 LayerDrop 的 soft 版本\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Structured dropout on entire transformer layers during training.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  multi_turn_attention:\\\\n    description: \\\\\\\"Attention degradation and instruction following failure in multi-turn or long-context scenarios\\\\\\\"\\\\n    papers:\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"When Attention Closes: How LLMs Lose the Thread in Multi-Turn Interaction\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Dongre, Hsieh, Lai, Yoon, Bui, Hakkani-Tur\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2026\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2026\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.12922\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"定义 GAR，诊断多轮 attention 通道关闭。纯诊断论文，未提出干预方案。ThreadGate 是首个基于其诊断的干预方法\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Channel-transition account: goal tokens become less accessible through attention while goal info persists in residual representations. Introduces GAR metric.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        notes:\\\\n          gar_definition: \\\\\\\"GAR(τ) = (1/L·H·|ℛτ|) Σℓ Σh Σi∈ℛτ Σj∈𝒢 A_{i,j}. ALL layers, ALL heads averaged. Goal tokens = system prompt task-specifying tokens only\\\\\\\"\\\\n          models_tested: \\\\\\\"Mistral-7B, LLaMA-3.1-8B, Qwen-2.5 (3B/7B/14B/32B), Mixtral-8x7B + 6 additional\\\\\\\"\\\\n          gar_decline: \\\\\\\"27-48% over 50 turns, monotonic (Mann-Kendall p<1e-7)\\\\\\\"\\\\n          residual_probes: \\\\\\\"LDA on PCA-reduced residuals (50 PCs). Peak AUC: LLaMA L2=0.99, Qwen L11=0.98, Mixtral L21=0.99, Mistral L27=0.87\\\\\\\"\\\\n          qwen_layer_profile: \\\\\\\"Goal encoding rises steeply from L5. Our v3b L4 outlier may be the layer just before goal encoding begins\\\\\\\"\\\\n          intervention_tested: \\\\\\\"Periodic goal re-injection FAILED (Appendix H)\\\\\\\"\\\\n          no_solution: true\\\\n          sliding_window: \\\\\\\"Attention mask W=4096, Qwen crossover at turn 20. Linear W-vs-crossover (R2~1)\\\\\\\"\\\\n          framing_impact: \\\\\\\"GAR not our original metric. No intervention proposed -> ThreadGate is first solution. Residual persistence directly supports our theory\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"LLMs Get Lost In Multi-Turn Conversation\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Levy et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.06120\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"量化多轮对话性能衰减：平均下降 39%，不可靠性增加 112%\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"All top LLMs exhibit significantly lower performance in multi-turn vs single-turn, averaging 39% drop.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Intent Mismatch Causes LLMs to Get Lost in Multi-Turn Conversation\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Liu et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2026\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2026\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.07338\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: context\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"多轮失败根因是 intent alignment gap，scaling 无法解决。支撑 ThreadGate 架构级方案动机\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Lost in Conversation stems from intent alignment gap, not capability deficits. Scaling cannot resolve.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Lost in the Middle: How Language Models Use Long Contexts\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Liu et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"TACL 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2023\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.03172\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"U 型 attention 分布（首尾强、中间弱）。多轮场景是此现象在 turn boundary 上的扩展\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Performance highest at beginning/end of context, degrading for middle positions.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Style Amnesia: Investigating Speaking Style Degradation and Mitigation in Multi-Turn Spoken Language Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Anonymous\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.23578\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: context\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"多轮对话中 style instruction 遵循衰减，system message 比 user message 更严重\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Style instruction in system messages degrades more than in user messages across turns.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  residual_gating:\\\\n    description: \\\\\\\"Gating mechanisms for transformer residual connections and adaptive depth\\\\\\\"\\\\n    papers:\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Mixture-of-Depths: Dynamically allocating compute in transformer-based language models\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Raposo et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2024 (Google DeepMind)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2404.02258\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"top-k routing 动态分配计算。ThreadGate 可视为 MoD 在 turn boundary 上的特化\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Dynamically allocate FLOPs per layer via top-k routing. 1.5% loss improvement or 50% FLOP reduction.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Confident Adaptive Language Modeling (CALM)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Schuster et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"NeurIPS 2022\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2022\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2207.07061\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"置信度 early exit。CALM 是 monotonic exit，ThreadGate 允许 selective layer gating\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Dynamically allocating compute per input based on confidence. Up to 3x speedup.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Gated Attention for Large Language Models: Non-linearity, Sparsity, and Attention-Sink-Free\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Qiu et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"NeurIPS 2025 (Oral)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.06708\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"SDPA 输出加 sigmoid gate 消除 attention sink。可参考 head-specific sigmoid gate 设计\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Head-specific sigmoid gate after SDPA. Eliminates attention sink (83% to 4%).\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"SkipNet: Learning Dynamic Routing in Convolutional Networks\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Wang et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ECCV 2018\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2018\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1711.09485\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: method-component\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"残差网络逐层 gating 先驱。ThreadGate per-layer gating 的前身\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Gating network to selectively skip convolutional blocks. RL+SL hybrid training.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Adaptive Layer-skipping in Pre-trained LLMs (FlexiDepth)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Luo et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.23798\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: direct-competitor\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"plug-in router+adapter on frozen LLM 自适应 layer skipping。与 ThreadGate 高度类似，直接竞品\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Dynamically adjusts layers via plug-in router and adapter. Llama-3-8B skips 8/32 layers maintaining performance.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Learning to Skip the Middle Layers of Transformers\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Lawson et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.21103\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: context\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"middle-out layer skipping 负面结果参考\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Gating to skip middle blocks. Does not improve vs dense baselines at investigated scales.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  attention_manipulation:\\\\n    description: \\\\\\\"Methods that modify attention weights, positional encoding, or attention distributions to handle long-range dependencies\\\\\\\"\\\\n    papers:\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Train Short, Test Long: Attention with Linear Biases Enables Input Length Extrapolation\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Press et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2022\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2022\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2108.12409\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"ALiBi 在注意力分数上施加距离线性惩罚实现长度外推，是注意力操纵路线的代表方法，与 ThreadGate 残差门控路线形成设计空间对比\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Replaces positional embeddings with linear bias on attention logits penalizing distance. 1.3B model trained on 1024 generalizes to 2048 without fine-tuning.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Extending Context Window of Large Language Models via Positional Interpolation\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Chen et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2023\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2023\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.15595\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"位置插值通过压缩 RoPE 索引扩展上下文至 32k，属于注意力机制内部解决长序列的路线，与 ThreadGate 在残差层解决多轮衰减形成对比\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Linearly down-scales RoPE position indices to extend context to 32768 tokens in 1000 fine-tuning steps.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"YaRN: Efficient Context Window Extension of Large Language Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Peng et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.00071\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"YaRN 综合 NTK-aware 和分段插值改进 RoPE 外推，代表注意力位置编码修改应对长程衰减的成熟路线，与 ThreadGate 机制不同\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Combines NTK-aware interpolation with ramp function for different RoPE frequency components. Extends LLaMA-2 to 128k context with 10x fewer tokens.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Efficient Streaming Language Models with Attention Sinks\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Xiao et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.17453\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: context\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"发现 attention sink 现象（初始 token 聚集高权重），说明多轮对话中早期轮次 token 天然受偏置，ThreadGate 从残差路径角度控制历史轮信息保留\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"LLMs assign disproportionate attention to first few tokens regardless of semantics. Retaining sink tokens enables stable streaming inference over 4M tokens.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"LM-Infinite: Zero-Shot Extreme Length Generalization for Large Language Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Han et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ACL 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2308.16137\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: context\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"用 Λ 形注意力掩码加距离截断实现超长上下文推理，揭示调整注意力掩码和调整残差门控是两条平行路线\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Applies Λ-shaped attention mask plus distance limit on position encodings. Generalizes to 200M tokens with 2.7x speedup, no parameter updates.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Found in the Middle: Calibrating Positional Attention Bias Improves Long Context Utilization\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Ko et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.16008\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: direct-competitor\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"直接校准注意力位置偏置修复中段信息丢失，最接近 ThreadGate 问题定义的注意力方案，审稿人会以此质疑为何不直接修正注意力\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Identifies U-shaped positional attention bias causing lost-in-the-middle. Training-free calibration redistributes attention to middle positions, improving QA by 6-15pp.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  theoretical_foundations:\\\\n    description: \\\\\\\"Theoretical analysis of transformer residual streams, information flow, and attention dynamics\\\\\\\"\\\\n    papers:\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"A Mathematical Framework for Transformer Circuits\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Elhage et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"Transformer Circuits Thread 2021\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2021\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://transformer-circuits.pub/2021/framework/index.html\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"提出残差流作为 transformer 各组件通信核心通道，直接为 ThreadGate 在残差连接处插入门控提供机制解释框架\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Linear algebraic decomposition of transformer computations. Attention heads and MLPs as read/write operations on shared residual stream. Formalizes induction heads and QK/OV circuits.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Toy Models of Superposition\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Elhage et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2022\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2022\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2209.10652\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"揭示残差流子空间叠加存储稀疏特征的机制，为 ThreadGate 按轮次条件化选择性激活残差通道提供理论依据\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Neural networks store more features than dimensions via superposition when features are sparse. Links polysemanticity to geometry of uniform polytopes.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Eliciting Latent Predictions from Transformers with the Tuned Lens\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Belrose et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2023\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2023\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.08112\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"逐层解码残差流隐状态揭示信息在深度方向渐进精化，支撑 ThreadGate 不同层门控强度差异化设计的动机\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Per-layer affine probes decode intermediate residual stream states into vocabulary distributions. Shows predictions iteratively refined across depth up to 20B parameters.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Exploring the Residual Stream of Transformers\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Yu et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2023\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2023\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.12141\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"分析残差连接对 logit 空间的加法效应，揭示知识参数跨层分布规律，为 ThreadGate 定位门控插入层提供实证参考\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Residual connections act as direct additive operations on pre-softmax logits. Identifies factual knowledge storage distribution across layers and modules.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Attention with Markov: A Framework for Principled Analysis of Transformers via Markov Chains\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Makkuva et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.04161\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"用 Markov 链理论刻画注意力深度依赖性，解释为何单层 transformer 无法形成归纳头，支持 ThreadGate 在多层残差路径施加门控的必要性\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Theoretical framework via Markov chain properties. Two-layer transformers learn induction heads on first-order Markov data; single-layer models get trapped in unigram minima.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"From Self-Attention to Markov Models: Unveiling the Dynamics of Generative Transformers\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Ildiz et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICML 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.13512\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"建立自注意力与上下文条件 Markov 链的精确映射，为分析多轮对话 token 分布随轮次漂移（GAR decay）提供随机过程理论基础\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Mathematical equivalence between self-attention and context-conditioned Markov chains. Output distribution sampled from context-weighted transition matrix.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  evaluation_benchmarks:\\\\n    description: \\\\\\\"Multi-turn dialogue and instruction-following evaluation benchmarks for LLMs\\\\\\\"\\\\n    papers:\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Judging LLM-as-a-Judge with MT-Bench and Chatbot Arena\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Zheng et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"NeurIPS 2023\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2023\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.05685\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"MT-Bench 多轮对话评测框架，是 ThreadGate 验证多轮 GAR 衰减修复效果的核心 benchmark\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Introduces MT-Bench (80 multi-turn questions) and Chatbot Arena. GPT-4 achieves >80% agreement with human preferences as judge.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Chatbot Arena: An Open Platform for Evaluating LLMs by Human Preference\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Chiang et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ICML 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.04132\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"基于 ELO 排名的人类偏好评估体系，衡量多轮对话模型综合能力的权威 leaderboard\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Chatbot Arena with 240K+ votes from 90K+ users across 50+ models. Bradley-Terry and ELO ranking validated against expert raters.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"Length-Controlled AlpacaEval: A Simple Way to Debias Automatic Evaluators\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Dubois et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"COLM 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2404.04475\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"指令遵循自动评测标准，Length-Controlled 版本修正长度偏差，为 ThreadGate 单轮指令评测提供对比基线\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"GLM-based length debiasing for AlpacaEval. Validated against 20K human annotations.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"WildBench: Benchmarking LLMs with Challenging Tasks from Real Users in the Wild\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Lin et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.04770\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: foundation\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"真实用户多样化指令集，评估 wild 场景指令遵循能力，与 ThreadGate 关注的真实多轮对话性能高度相关\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"1,024 challenging tasks from 1M+ conversation logs. WB-Reward/WB-Score achieve 0.98 Pearson correlation with Chatbot Arena ELO on hard tasks.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"MT-Bench-101: A Fine-Grained Benchmark for Evaluating Large Language Models in Multi-Turn Dialogues\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Bai et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"ACL 2024\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2024\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.14762\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: direct-competitor\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"多轮对话细粒度评测体系，直接测量跨轮次能力退化，与 ThreadGate 研究的 GAR 衰减高度吻合\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Three-tier ability taxonomy, 4,208 turns across 1,388 dialogues in 13 tasks. Neither alignment nor chat-specific designs consistently improve multi-turn abilities.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - title: \\\\\\\"MultiChallenge: A Realistic Multi-Turn Conversation Evaluation Benchmark Challenging to Frontier LLMs\\\\\\\"\\\\n        authors: \\\\\\\"Sirdeshmukh et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n        venue: \\\\\\\"arXiv 2025\\\\\\\"\\\\n        year: 2025\\\\n        url: \\\\\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.17399\\\\\\\"\\\\n        role: direct-competitor\\\\n        relevance: \\\\\\\"前沿 LLM 多轮对话准确率不足 50%，直接测量 ThreadGate 旨在修复的跨轮指令保留和上下文一致性失败\\\\\\\"\\\\n        abstract: \\\\\\\"Four challenge categories: instruction retention, user inference memory, versioned editing, self-coherence. All frontier LLMs below 50%; Claude 3.5 Sonnet tops at 41.4%.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 17806, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011dmdW3GZyHJXDsjZrxj7EN","session_id":"a8db08cb-5504-474b-a8d9-cc4664a111cc","uuid":"4132900f-58b6-487c-9350-90001970dfa7","timestamp":"2026-05-19T14:27:20.173Z"}
